              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpela mundu jwa masoka jwakusagamba kuponya malamba gamoto pane mipamba jakogoya, ni myoyo peyo soni mwakusaŵela mundu jwakwanyenga acimjakwe pakutiga, “Iyayi, ngambileje kwelegula!”",
          "type": "text",
